title    Steam Calliope
composer Claude (ShooterCoaster)
about    Theme Park option "calliope": a whirling steam-calliope riff in B-flat major on pipe organ, organ "pah" chords and a xylophone double over power-chord guitar and a rock beat. The last eight bars lift a tone, to C major.
tempo    148
beats    4
steps    2
reverb   0.24

voice lead   pipe       vol=0.62 bright=1.2
voice xylo   xylophone  vol=0.4  oct=1 pan=0.3
voice pah    organ      vol=0.26 pan=0.35 center=F4 gate=0.55
voice gtr    distguitar vol=0.34 pan=-0.35 gate=0.5
voice bass   fmbass     vol=0.52  gate=0.7
voice hit    orchhit    vol=0.4
voice rise   riser      vol=0.28
voice kick   bigkick    vol=0.6
voice snare  snare      vol=0.62 pan=0.05
voice hat    hat909     vol=0.26 pan=0.3
voice crash  crash      vol=0.3  pan=-0.2

